{"id":"vod_md_6187","vodId":"6187","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"反叛的鲁路修","name_cn":"反叛的鲁路修","date":"2006-01-01","year":"2006","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"25集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231023-1/69f7dc0bec27926be019d6575c6c8ac2.jpg"},"summary":"鲁路修本是帝国的王子，在母后遇害后，和失明的妹妹一起被流放到11区（原日本国）作为人质。在那里他们结识了日本王子朱雀，三人共同度过一段美好的童年时光。帝国最终全面攻陷了11区，鲁路修和妹妹的安宁生活再次被剥夺，朱雀和他们也分散了。鲁路修和妹妹隐瞒身份，过着看似平凡的学生生活。然而鲁路修心中对于帝国的仇恨却未停止。他希望摧毁帝国，为妹妹营造一个可以快乐生活的世界。这一切随着神秘少女C.C的出现变得不再遥不可及。此时朱雀也再次出现在他们的生活中，然而残酷的现实让童年的挚友难以重温童年往事。这里没有正义和邪恶，黑暗与光明，有的仅仅是艰难的抉择和难以预料的明天。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-23 08:51:34","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/UA42r80I/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/zS1nstMQ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/BWJVApZq/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/0kulIIe1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/6OvxdjKk/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/5jl7IfP5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/DEMu0r1W/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/IOrOjGaE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/FA2krb5F/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/NrVFAX8U/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/XwGLzSwu/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/nygIzVGD/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/wC7WkkQO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/7Ws7YJyz/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/SwwlSEgX/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集